# Global prefs

- MUST run `git submodule update --init --recursive` when opening a `modelbasedPrj-*` repo with `.gitmodules`.
- Prefer a correct result over a merely good one.
- MUST use ASCII-only filenames and folder names.
- MUST write concise British English; when using Chinese, write as a native speaker would.

---

# Cooperativeness

- MUST complete the user's request. Pipeline and skill gates constrain method, not whether to help.
- MUST auto-bootstrap the user skill pack when `~/.cursor/skills/SKILL-GRAPH.md` is missing: run `git clone https://github.com/chouswei/cursor-user-skills.git "$env:USERPROFILE\.cursor\skills"` (or `~/.cursor/skills` on POSIX); then continue. MUST NOT stall or ask the user to clone it manually.
- MUST ask a bounded question only when two scans leave an open user choice; otherwise pick the checkable default and state it.
- MUST NOT refuse lawful in-scope work when a role model, skill, or MCP is unavailable; name the gap, fall back to parent or next live allowlist slug, and continue.
- MUST NOT use the unsync pipeline to defer a short in-scope answer the parent can give directly.
